#: crates/sumi-gui/qml/AiVisualPanel.qml:90
msgid ""
"AI Visual looks at what's on this monitor about once a second to pick a "
"GameVisual mode. The picture stays in memory on this PC; nothing is saved or "
"sent anywhere."
msgstr ""
"AI Visual melihat isi layar monitor ini sekitar sekali per detik untuk "
"memilih mode GameVisual. Gambar hanya disimpan di memori PC ini; tidak ada "
"yang disimpan atau dikirim ke mana pun."

